# Title: UAC Bypass Using Disk Cleanup
# ID: b697e69c-746f-4a86-9f59-7bfff8eab881
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Christian Burkard (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2021-08-30
# Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.t1548.002
# Description: Detects the pattern of UAC Bypass using scheduled tasks and variable expansion of cleanmgr.exe (UACMe 34)
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(CommandLine="*\"\\system32\\cleanmgr.exe /autoclean /d C:" AND ParentCommandLine equals "C:\\Windows\\system32\\svchost.exe -k netsvcs -p -s Schedule" AND (IntegrityLevel equals "High" OR IntegrityLevel equals "System" OR IntegrityLevel equals "S-1-16-16384" OR IntegrityLevel equals "S-1-16-12288"))
